From: Simon Hausmann <simon.hausmann@slint.dev>
Subject: [PATCH] Distrust the compromised eMudhra roots

Blacklist "emSign ECC Root CA - G3" and "Comodo AAA Services root", as
Debian 20260816+nmu1 does. The hunk inserts the labels at the top of the
file without context lines, so that it applies to every version of
blacklist.txt.

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://salsa.debian.org/debian/ca-certificates/-/commit/4a0203e5ce4ce1a064b97387f52ca6a00c97185c]
Signed-off-by: Simon Hausmann <simon.hausmann@slint.dev>
---
 mozilla/blacklist.txt | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

--- a/mozilla/blacklist.txt
+++ b/mozilla/blacklist.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Blacklist the roots behind the compromised eMudhra intermediates (cf. #1151413)
+"emSign ECC Root CA - G3"
+"Comodo AAA Services root"
